  "body": "# AgalarMC Create\n\n![AgalarMC Create modpack title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00e7893e8cecabe8c9f3bc44ac31f47e3266855a.jpeg)\n\n**Hello there!** Are you a Create enthusiast who likes messing around with automation and Aeronautics' physics shenenigans; but someone who **doesn't like** a kitchen sink type of modpack with absurd dimensions, unnecessary quests, or far from vanilla overpowered gear, like me? Well, I just got the modpack for you.\n\nThis pack is built around **Create, Aeronautics, and Farmer's Delight**, with a few handpicked and vanilla-friendly **addons**, lots of cool **QoL** additions, **visual** and **performance** side improvements, **backported content** from latest versions, and some other vanilla-friendly content mods.\n\nSo it's a **vanilla-plus-PLUS** modpack which stays true to vanilla, but at the same time not some nothingburger pack with shaders+performance strapped into a random gazillion Create addons.\n\n*Note that this pack is still in beta so some recently added or removed mods might not immediately appear on the list bellow, but I will update them as soon as possible.*\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/LNytGWDc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LNytGWDc/61d716699bcf1ec42ed4926a9e1c7311be6087e2_96.webp\" width=\"110\"></a>   <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/oWaK0Q19\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oWaK0Q19/f66b5589924884ffd81acb27f3ccb775867a962e_96.webp\" width=\"110\"></a>   <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/R2OftAxM\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R2OftAxM/8e7aa38ab94d94bb0a2894a218b69beb49002b34.png\" width=\"110\"></a>\n\n**Create** · Aeronautics · **Farmer's Delight**\n\n<br>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/AANobbMI\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AANobbMI/295862f4724dc3f78df3447ad6072b2dcd3ef0c9_96.webp\" width=\"72\"></a>   <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/gvQqBUqZ\"><img src=\"https://cdn.