ata/zvaHXgQz/6402174e45c47abd56a5ee9a11d793b33f26af0e_96.webp\" width=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/hddN8ksR\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hddN8ksR/105d3ab0a1f101ba6b34685501d6df6bb4ab5fa4_96.webp\" width=\"56\"></a>\n\n**Aeronautics** · Bells & Whistles · **Better FPS** · Bits 'n' Bobs · **Central Kitchen** · Colorwheel · **Copycats+** · Copycats+ Aeronautics Weight · **Create** · Dragons Plus · **Dynamic Lights** · EMI: Create Schematics · **Enchantment Industry** · Factory Logistics · **Framed** · Jade Sable Compat · **Liquid Fuel** · Oxidized · **Pattern Schematics** · Power Loader · **Sable** · Sable Dynamic Lights (Aeronautics) · **Schematic Helper** · Sound of Steam · **Trimmed** · Vibrant Vaults\n\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## 👥 Multiplayer\n\nDo you want to play this modpack with your **friends?** Well, you got **two options:**\n\n**Option one:** Just download the modpack and use e4mc to let your friends join your singleplayer world hosted through your LAN. Once they download the modpack too they can just join the server and play, simple as that. No port forwarding or IP sharing required, but the downsides are that if you leave the world your server closes, and every time you share your world the server IP changes. If you are not okay with these, you might check out option two.\n\n**Option two:** If you want to rent your server from a hosting provider or if you are planning to make a dedicated server yourself; I have made a separate server-side modpack with only the necessary mods for the server (if you just use the normal modpack your server will crash because of the client-side mods), a few server-side performance mods, and some extra utility mods. It even supports offline servers with offline whitelist and authorization features. To not bloat this description, I will explain this option separately on the [AgalarMC Create Server](https://modrinth.com/modpack/agalarmc-create-server) page.\n\n---\n\n### Also try [AgalarMC Vanilla!](https://modrinth.com/modpack/agalarmc-vanilla)",
